      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NUTS THEN BOLTS (8) is a progressive dog who scored his 2nd career win last time at this track, scoring by 4.5 lengths (22.87). Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Great chance again. CLOSING MODEL (1) finished second (22.73) two back at this track but out of the placings last time when 6th there. Has never been out of the money in three starts this course and distance. The form out of her last race has been franked. A big run wouldn't surprise. HEY ZIPPER (5) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a 0.8 lengths second (23.05) behind Zipping Osaka at this track. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Expected to be in this for a long way. DEMENTIA (2) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to atone.",
